    descriptionEn: "\"Aberdeen indie\" is a streaming-platform label rather than a clearly defined musical style. It groups independent bands and artists tied to the local scene of Aberdeen, in north-east Scotland. In general it covers small-scale indie rock and indie pop, often driven by gigs in local venues. The scene remains mostly local and thinly documented.",
